sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Shopper
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant PG as PostgreSQL 16 (ACID DB)
    participant STRIPE as Stripe Payment Gateway
    participant RELAY as Outbox CDC Relay
    participant K as Kafka Broker
    participant R as Redis Cluster

    Shopper->>GW: POST /api/v1/flash-sale/checkout {reservationId, paymentMethodToken} (Header: Idempotency-Key)
    GW->>OS: Forward Checkout Request
    
    OS->>PG: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    OS->>PG: SELECT * FROM idempotency_keys WHERE key = ? FOR UPDATE
    alt Duplicate Request Detected
        OS->>PG: ROLLBACK
        OS-->>Shopper: Return Cached Response (HTTP 200 OK)
    end

    OS->>STRIPE: POST /v1/payment_intents/confirm (charge card)
    STRIPE-->>OS: Return Charge Succeeded {chargeId: ch_12345}

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
    Note over OS,PG: Single ACID Transaction Boundary
    OS->>PG: INSERT INTO orders (order_id, user_id, reservation_id, status='CONFIRMED')
    OS->>PG: UPDATE reservations SET status='PURCHASED' WHERE id = reservationId
    OS->>PG: INSERT INTO outbox_events (event_type='OrderConfirmed', payload={...})
    OS->>PG: INSERT INTO idempotency_keys (key, response_hash, status='COMPLETED')
    OS->>PG: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    end

    OS->>R: PERSIST reservation:purchased:{reservationId} (Clean up TTL lease)
    OS-->>Shopper: HTTP 200 OK {orderId, status: "CONFIRMED", receiptUrl}

    Note over RELAY,K: Asynchronous Event Dispatch (Zero Loss)
    RELAY->>PG: Poll / Read WAL stream for unpublished outbox_events
    RELAY->>K: Publish to 'salestorm.orders.created.v1'
    RELAY->>PG: UPDATE outbox_events SET published = TRUE WHERE event_id = ?
